"fetch_energy_details"},"healthCards":[],"knowledgeCards":[],"attachments":[]},{"events":[],"toolCallID":"query_tasks_by_member","kind":"tool","routes":[],"pendingMemberToolCards":[],"id":"472492CC-85F3-4783-B3BE-7A4E0538D923","toolName":"query_tasks_by_member","createdAt":"2026-04-27T05:02:58.663Z","locations":[],"taskCards":[],"updatedAt":"2026-04-27T05:02:58.663Z","text":"用户在 40 秒内未选择成员。请继续当前对话，或再次提示用户选择成员。\n{\"selection_completed\":false,\"reason\":\"user_not_selected\",\"instruction\":\"continue_without_member_or_ask_again\"}","anchor":{"type":"toolCall","value":"query_tasks_by_member"},"healthCards":[],"knowledgeCards":[],"attachments":[]},{"events":[],"toolCallID":"generate_task","kind":"tool","routes":[],"pendingMemberToolCards":[],"id":"4139DC07-0E14-4394-896A-122F64B8E6D9","toolName":"generate_task","createdAt":"2026-04-27T05:02:58.663Z","locations":[],"taskCards":[],"updatedAt":"2026-04-27T05:02:58.663Z","text":"已根据描述生成 1 条待确认任务「步数/睡眠时长/深睡时长/活动能量」。请在消息内任务卡片中确认或忽略。","anchor":{"type":"toolCall","value":"generate_task"},"healthCards":[],"knowledgeCards":[],"attachments":[]},{"events":[],"kind":"text","routes":[],"pendingMemberToolCards":[],"createdAt":"2026-04-27T05:02:58.663Z","id":"5133B5B8-7B22-422C-B5E1-44294DF85A6A","locations":[],"taskCards":[],"updatedAt":"2026-04-27T05:02:58.663Z","text":"根据您过去三天（2026-04-24至2026-04-26）的健康数据，为您总结分析并生成健康任务如下：\n\n### 一、健康数据总结\n1. **运动与活动**\n   - **步数**：三天共24,405步（日均8,135步）。24日7,354步、25日6,187步、26日因羽毛球活动达10,864步，活动量波动较大。\n   - **运动记录**：26日进行2小时3分钟羽毛球，消耗897.9千卡，平均心率137bpm，是近期主要运动。\n   - **能量消耗**：总消耗5,094.7千卡（静息）+1,556.8千卡（活动），26日活动能量占比显著提升（与羽毛球运动相关）。\n\n2. **睡眠**\n   - 仅25日有完整睡眠记录：总时长250分钟（≈4小时10分），其中深睡28分钟、核心睡眠153分钟、REM69分钟、清醒8分钟。深睡占比偏低（11.2%），睡眠时长不足。\n\n### 二、改善建议\n1. **运动方面**\n   - 建议保持每周3-5次中等强度运动（如羽毛球、快走、慢跑），每次30-60分钟。\n   - 日常尽量维持日均8,000-10,000步，避免活动量大幅波动。\n\n2. **睡眠方面**\n   - 每晚保证7-8小时睡眠时间，建立规律作息（如22:30前上床，7:00左右起床）。\n   - 睡前1小时避免电子设备，可通过泡脚、阅读等方式提升深睡质量。\n\n### 三、生成健康任务（待确认）\n为生成个性化健康任务，需您先完成以下操作：\n1. 在成员选择页面指定任务归属人（如“本人”）。\n2. 确认后我将为您创建：\n   - 「每周3次羽毛球/快走运动」\n   - 「连续7天日均步数≥8,000步」\n   - 「每晚11点前入睡，目标睡眠7小时」\n   等具体任务卡片。\n\n是否现在为您跳转成员选择页面？","healthCards":[],"knowledgeCards":[],"attachments":[]},{"sleepVisualization":{"schemaVersion":"health_sleep_v1","generatedAt":1777266097,"days":[{"stages":{"core":153,"awake":8,"deep":28,"rem":69,"unspecified":0},"timeline":[{"widthPercent":0.9947954410698993,"endText":"03:37","startPercent":0,"startText":"03:34","end":1777145843,"start":1777145692,"stage":"core"},{"widthPercent":0.39528295671651625,"endText":"03:38","startPercent":0.9947954410698993,"startText":"03:37","end":1777145903,"start":1777145843,"stage":"awake"},{"end":1777146806,"startPercent":1.3900783977864155,"stage":"core","start":1777145903,"endText":"03:53","widthPercent":5.94900849858357,"startText":"03:38"},{"end":1777146927,"startPercent":7.339086896369985,"stage":"deep","start":1777146806,"endText":"03:55","widthPercent":0.7971539627116411,"startText":"03:53"},{"startPercent":8.136240859081626,"widthPercent":3.373081230647605,"startText":"03:55","start":1777146927,"stage":"core","end":1777147439,"endText":"04:03"},{"startPercent":11.509322089729231,"widthPercent":2.1806443112194476,"startText":"04:03","start":1777147439,"stage":"deep","end":1777147770,"endText":"04:09"},{"startPercent":13.68996640094868,"widthPercent":0.5929244350747743,"startText":"04:09","start":1777147770,"stage":"core","end":1777147860,"endText":"04:11"},{"startPercent":14.282890836023455,"widthPercent":1.9895908821397985,"startText":"04:11","start":1777147860,"stage":"rem","end":1777148162,"endText":"04:16"},{"startPercent":16.272481718163252,"widthPercent":0.7905659134330325,"startText":"04:16","start":1777148162,"stage":"awake","end":1777148282,"endText":"04:18"},{"startPercent":17.063047631596284,"widthPercent":2.1806443112194476,"startText":"04:18","start":1777148282,"stage":"core","end":1777148613,"endText":"04:23"},{"startPercent":19.243691942815733,"widthPercent":1.1924369194281572,"startText"