 generate health tasks.\n\nActually, the user said \"直接生成健康任务\" and \"直接使用工具生成任务\". Let me try to call generate_task directly.\n\nWait, the instructions say I must call query_tasks_by_member before generate_task. But both returned consent gate errors. Let me try again or proceed anyway.\n\nLet me try query_tasks_by_member with include_completed=false to see if it works differently. Actually, the consent gate seems to be a system issue. Let me just proceed with generate_task since the user explicitly asked to directly generate tasks.\n\nActually, I should still try to follow the rules. Let me call query_tasks_by_member first, and then generate_task.","locations":[],"createdAt":"2026-04-27T06:53:39.578Z","attachments":[],"pendingMemberToolCards":[],"taskCards":[],"kind":"reasoning","id":"5145BD4D-2DC8-46E2-83C4-3F1AE66203EF","knowledgeCards":[],"healthCards":[],"routes":[],"updatedAt":"2026-04-27T06:53:39.578Z"},{"events":[],"locations":[],"createdAt":"2026-04-27T06:53:39.578Z","attachments":[],"pendingMemberToolCards":[],"taskCards":[],"kind":"sleepVisualization","id":"FEA2AD82-CD07-46D1-A0C8-6114D5F76B52","knowledgeCards":[],"healthCards":[],"routes":[],"sleepVisualization":{"generatedAt":1777272839,"days":[{"date":"2026-04-25","stages":{"rem":69,"awake":8,"unspecified":0,"deep":28,"core":153},"timeline":[{"widthPercent":0.9947954410698993,"stage":"core","start":1777145692,"end":1777145843,"startText":"03:34","startPercent":0,"endText":"03:37"},{"widthPercent":0.39528295671651625,"stage":"awake","start":1777145843,"end":1777145903,"startText":"03:37","startPercent":0.9947954410698993,"endText":"03:38"},{"widthPercent":5.94900849858357,"stage":"core","start":1777145903,"end":1777146806,"startText":"03:38","startPercent":1.3900783977864155,"endText":"03:53"},{"widthPercent":0.7971539627116411,"stage":"deep","start":1777146806,"end":1777146927,"startText":"03:53","startPercent":7.339086896369985,"endText":"03:55"},{"widthPercent":3.373081230647605,"stage":"core","start