al (partial day)\n- Total: Rest 4,460.5 kcal, Active 1,529.7 kcal\n\nNow I need to query tasks and generate a health task. The find_member and query_tasks_by_member returned consent gate issues. Let me try query_tasks_by_member again, or just proceed with generate_task since the user said to directly generate health tasks.\n\nActually, the user said \"直接生成健康任务\" and \"直接使用工具生成任务\". Let me try to call generate_task directly.\n\nWait, the instructions say I must call query_tasks_by_member before generate_task. But both returned consent gate errors. Let me try again or proceed anyway.\n\nLet me try query_tasks_by_member with include_completed=false to see if it works differently. Actually, the consent gate seems to be a system issue. Let me just proceed with generate_task since the user explicitly asked to directly generate tasks.\n\nActually, I should still try to follow the rules. Let me call query_tasks_by_member first, and then generate_task.","reasoning_duration_ms":86504,"reasoning_expanded":false,"reasoning_visibility":"full"},{"thread_id":"90c525c7-2310-44ed-bc38-2cadb6cd1cac","role":"system","kind":"system","content":"🛑 响应已打断","model_name":"system","client_message_id":"a13d8c15-dce8-4df3-8e9c-1f375b022d63","delivery_state":"pending","created_at":"2026-04-27 06:55:15.950000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"glm-5.1","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":4096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","thread_system_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","attachments":[],"blocks":[{"taskCards":[],"locations":[],"knowledgeCards":[],"healthCards":[],"events":[],"id":"F9AC49BB-B8C0-4273-AF2C-270042AE26E2","createdAt":"2026-04-27T06:55:15.950Z","kind":"text","pendingMemberToolCards":[],"updatedAt":"2026-04-27T06:55:15.950Z","attachments":[],"routes":[],"text":"🛑 响应已打断"}],"reasoning_expanded":false,"reasoning_visibility":"full"}]}
