ToolCards":[],"createdAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:18.394Z","locations":[],"knowledgeCards":[],"toolName":"fetch_workout_details","attachments":[],"taskCards":[],"events":[],"healthCards":[],"routes":[],"kind":"tool","id":"96A32E0F-41B7-4C54-A6E9-5FA1CE4F9CCF","text":"运动记录 2026-04-24 - 2026-04-26:\n- 2026年4月26日 18:59: 羽毛球，时长 2小时3分钟，距离 2.21 公里，活动能量 897.9 千卡，平均心率 137 bpm","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:18.394Z","toolCallID":"fetch_workout_details","anchor":{"value":"fetch_workout_details","type":"toolCall"}},{"pendingMemberToolCards":[],"createdAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:18.394Z","locations":[],"knowledgeCards":[],"toolName":"query_tasks_by_member","attachments":[],"taskCards":[],"events":[],"healthCards":[],"routes":[],"kind":"tool","id":"8B79C993-AB50-4C1E-9C82-BD74CFFB3649","text":"{\"tasks\":[{\"creator\":6,\"member\":24,\"id\":14,\"due_time\":799492624.625,\"extra\":{},\"updated_at\":798887897.4560001,\"status\":0,\"description\":\"目标：减肥\\n动作：控制饮食减重\\n计划：daily\\n强度：每日热量控制\",\"priority\":1,\"source\":0,\"title\":\"减肥\",\"notification_id\":\"\",\"repeat_type\":2,\"business_id\":\"\",\"created_at\":798887897.4560001,\"task_diet\":{\"food_recommend\":[\"减肥\"],\"description\":\"控制饮食减重\",\"calorie_target\":1800,\"id\":1,\"source\":\"ai\",\"extra\":{},\"meal_type\":\"dinner\",\"status\":0},\"type\":2,\"start_time\":798887824.625,\"business_type\":\"ai_task_generation\"},{\"creator\":6,\"member\":24,\"id\":13,\"due_time\":798966707.8900001,\"extra\":{},\"updated_at\":798880335.3469999,\"task_medical\":{\"medical_task_type\":\"血脂\",\"description\":\"口腔清洁、胃部护理、血脂调整\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"extra\":{},\"id\":9,\"status\":0,\"reminder_time\":798880307},\"status\":0,\"description\":\"目标：血脂\\n动作：口腔清洁、胃部护理、血脂调整\\n计划：daily\\n强度：每天 2 次\",\"priority\":1,\"source\":0,\"title\":\"血脂\",\"notification_id\":\"\",\"repeat_type\":0,\"business_id\":\"\",\"created_at\":798880335.3469999,\"type\":0,\"start_time\":798880307.8900001,\"business_type\":\"ai_task_generation\"}],\"total\":2,\"ok\":true,\"member_id\":24,\"queried_at\":\"2026-04-27T07:46:44.156Z\"}","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:18.394Z","toolCallID":"query_tasks_by_member","anchor":{"value":"query_tasks_by_member","type":"toolCall"}},{"pendingMemberToolCards":[],"createdAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:18.394Z","locations":[],"knowledgeCards":[],"toolName":"generate_task","attachments":[],"taskCards":[],"events":[],"healthCards":[],"routes":[],"kind":"tool","id":"E4E0F1B4-64AC-4949-B951-93DD9E745659","text":"已根据描述生成 1 条待确认任务「步数|活动能量|睡眠时长|深睡占比」。请在消息内任务卡片中确认或忽略。","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:18.394Z","toolCallID":"generate_task","anchor":{"value":"generate_task","type":"toolCall"}},{"pendingMemberToolCards":[],"createdAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:18.394Z","locations":[],"knowledgeCards":[],"attachments":[],"taskCards":[],"events":[],"healthCards":[],"routes":[],"kind":"text","id":"C8B5A531-0673-4988-AD3F-02C8F1A32381","text":"根据过去三天（2026-04-24至2026-04-26）的健康数据分析，为您生成以下健康任务：\n\n1. **每日步行任务**：每日完成8000步以上步行，可分时段完成（如上午3000步、下午3000步、晚上2000步），以提高基础活动量。\n2. **规律运动任务**：每周进行至少3次中等强度运动（如羽毛球、快走、骑行等），每次持续30分钟以上，可安排在周一、周三、周五晚间进行。\n3. **睡眠改善任务**：建立规律睡眠习惯，每日22:30前准备入睡，保证7-8小时睡眠时间；睡前1小时避免使用电子设备，可通过阅读或冥想增加深睡占比。\n4. **活动能量稳定任务**：非运动日通过增加日常活动（如做家务、站立办公）保证每日活动能量消耗不低于300千卡。\n\n请点击确认任务以开始执行，或根据实际情况调整任务细节。","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:18.394Z"}],"reasoning_expanded":false,"reasoning_visibility":"full"}]}
