4103-AC10-C4587A0EB54E","knowledgeCards":[]},{"kind":"text","events":[],"updatedAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:18.346Z","attachments":[],"locations":[],"routes":[],"createdAt":"2026-04-27T07:47:06.175Z","healthCards":[],"taskCards":[],"text":"根据过去三天（2026-04-24至2026-04-26）的健康数据分析，为您生成以下健康任务：\n\n1. **每日步行任务**：每日完成8000步以上步行，可分时段完成（如上午3000步、下午3000步、晚上2000步），以提高基础活动量。\n2. **规律运动任务**：每周进行至少3次中等强度运动（如羽毛球、快走、骑行等），每次持续30分钟以上，可安排在周一、周三、周五晚间进行。\n3. **睡眠改善任务**：建立规律睡眠习惯，每日22:30前准备入睡，保证7-8小时睡眠时间；睡前1小时避免使用电子设备，可通过阅读或冥想增加深睡占比。\n4. **活动能量稳定任务**：非运动日通过增加日常活动（如做家务、站立办公）保证每日活动能量消耗不低于300千卡。\n\n请点击确认任务以开始执行，或根据实际情况调整任务细节。","pendingMemberToolCards":[],"id":"68ADE4F2-C7E5-4DB8-BCB3-3100328A284B","knowledgeCards":[]},{"sleepVisualization":{"schemaVersion":"health_sleep_v1","generatedAt":1777275988,"days":[{"date":"2026-04-25","summary":{"end":1777160871,"startText":"03:34","endText":"07:47","totalSleepMinutes":250,"start":1777145692},"stages":{"awake":8,"rem":69,"unspecified":0,"core":153,"deep":28},"timeline":[{"endText":"03:37","startPercent":0,"startText":"03:34","end":1777145843,"stage":"core","widthPercent":0.9947954410698993,"start":1777145692},{"endText":"03:38","startPercent":0.9947954410698993,"startText":"03:37","end":1777145903,"stage":"awake","widthPercent":0.39528295671651625,"start":1777145843},{"endText":"03:53","startPercent":1.3900783977864155,"startText":"03:38","end":1777146806,"stage":"core","widthPercent":5.94900849858357,"start":1777145903},{"endText":"03:55","startPercent":7.339086896369985,"startText":"03:53","end":1777146927,"stage":"deep","widthPercent":0.7971539627116411,"start":1777146806},{"endText":"04:03","startPercent":8.136240859081626,"startText":"03:55","end":1777147439,"stage":"core","widthPercent":3.373081230647605,"start":1777146927},{"endText":"04:09","startPercent":11.509322089729231,"startText":"04:03","end":1777147770,"stage":"deep","widthPercent":2.1806443112194476,"start":1777147439},{"endText":"04:11","startPercent":13.68996640094868,"startText":"04:09","