个工具在使用前都需要说明为什么调用\n直接使用工具生成任务\n\n【允许工具】\nfetch_energy_details, fetch_nutrition_details, fetch_sleep_details, fetch_step_details, fetch_workout_details, find_member, generate_task, query_tasks_by_member","role":"system"},{"content":"请执行小任务：健康分析","role":"user"},{"toolCalls":[{"arguments":"{\"start_date\": \"2026-04-24\", \"end_date\": \"2026-04-26\"}","id":"call_pmfy1cjln3rtcd4u1d5r973t","name":"fetch_workout_details"}],"role":"assistant"},{"content":"运动记录 2026-04-24 - 2026-04-26:\n- 2026年4月26日 18:59: 羽毛球，时长 2小时3分钟，距离 2.21 公里，活动能量 897.9 千卡，平均心率 137 bpm","toolCallID":"call_pmfy1cjln3rtcd4u1d5r973t","role":"tool","name":"fetch_workout_details"},{"toolCalls":[{"arguments":"{\"start_date\": \"2026-04-24\", \"end_date\": \"2026-04-26\"}","id":"call_4m77upgeewemqw02inum56hw","name":"fetch_sleep_details"}],"role":"assistant"},{"content":"2026-04-25 睡眠时长 250 分钟（深睡 28 分钟，核心 153 分钟，REM 69 分钟，清醒 8 分钟）","toolCallID":"call_4m77upgeewemqw02inum56hw","role":"tool","name":"fetch_sleep_details"},{"toolCalls":[{"arguments":"{}","id":"call_6vm66gcrqddhdnb2oyyqg10a","name":"query_tasks_by_member"}],"role":"assistant"}],"status":"completed","resultText":"tool.result.request_member_selection.completed","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T15:37:13.000Z","toolName":"query_tasks_by_member","selectedMemberID":21,"reason":"query_tasks_by_member","id":"70C4E500-C8B8-4C5B-92B3-597350641208","toolCallID":"call_6vm66gcrqddhdnb2oyyqg10a","arguments":{"member_id":"21"},"createdAt":"2026-04-27T15:37:07.000Z"}],"createdAt":"2026-04-27T15:37:41.789Z","anchor":{"value":"call_6vm66gcrqddhdnb2oyyqg10a","type":"toolCall"}},{"kind":"tool","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T15:37:26.214Z","toolName":"generate_task","id":"5F7369FA-22A2-4668-AFFA-D8E3A43594B5","text":"正在使用工具：生成任务\n已根据描述生成 1 条待确认任务「运动频率|睡眠质量」。请在消息内任务卡片中确认或忽略。","toolCallID":"call_vzlpgl1s6kb6klrrnnrwh6xd","createdAt":"2026-04-27T15:37:16.222Z","anchor":{"value":"call_vzlpgl1s6kb6klrrnnrwh6xd","type":"toolCall"}},{"kind":"text","id":"1A8B3BAE-C000-459C-A7C2-3B8A6E5D411F","text":"1. **运动频率提升任务**：\n   - 主任务：每周至少完成3次中等强度运动（每次30分钟以上）\n     - 子任务1：明天（2026-04-28）进行30分钟快走或慢跑\n     - 子任务2：后天（2026-04-29）做一组20分钟的居家力量训练（如深蹲、俯卧撑）\n     - 子任务3：大后天（2026-04-30）再安排一次羽毛球或其他喜欢的运动\n\n2. **睡眠改善任务**：\n   - 主任务：一周内将睡眠总时长提升至每晚6.5小时以上，深睡占比提升至15%以上\n     - 子任务1：今天（2026-04-27）起建立睡前30分钟准备仪式（如泡脚、阅读纸质书、避免使用电子设备）\n     - 子任务2：明天（2026-04-28）开始记录睡眠日记，包括上床时间和起床时间\n     - 子任务3：后天（2026-04-29）尝试晚上11点前上床，早上7点前起床（保证8小时卧床时间）","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T15:37:41.789Z","createdAt":"2026-04-27T15:37:27.735Z"},{"kind":"sleepVisualization","id":"82E57638-F3CE-410C-AC0E-09056A5EECAB","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T15:37:41.789Z","createdAt":"2026-04-27T15:37:41.789Z","sleepVisualization":{"generatedAt":1777304224,"schemaVersion":"health_sleep_v1","days":[{"timeline":[{"start":1777145692,"startText":"03:34","stage":"core","startPercent":0,"widthPercent":0.9947954410698993,"endText":"03:37","end":1777145843},{"start":1777145843,"startText":"03:37","stage":"awake","startPercent":0.9947954410698993,"widthPercent":0.39528295671651625,"endText":"03:38","end":1777145903},{"start":1777145903,"startText":"03:38","stage":"core","startPercent":1.3900783977864155,"widthPercent":5.94900849858357,"endText":"03:53","end":1777146806},{"start":1777146806,"startText":"03:53","stage":"deep","startPercent":7.339086896369985,"widthPercent":0.7971539627116411,"endText":"03:55","end":1777146927},{"start":1777146927,"startText":"03:55","stage":"core","startPercent":8.136240859081626,"widthPercent":3.373081230647605,"endText":"04:03","end":1777147439},{"start":1777147439,"startText":"04:03","stage":"deep","startPercent":11.509322089729231,"widthPercent":2.1806443112194476,"endText":"04:09","end":1777147770},{"start":1777147770,"startText":"04:09","stage":"core","startPercent":13.68996640094868,"widthPercent":0.5929244350747743,"endText":"04:11","end":1777147860},{"start":1777147860,"startText":"04:11","stage":"rem","startPercent":14.282890836023455,"widthPercent":1.9895908821397985,"endText":"04:16","end":177