3. **睡眠改善计划**：目标：每日睡眠时长达到7-8小时。执行频率：每日。执行时间：22:30前入睡。","model_name":"agent-BDF88EAF-6D5E-4308-B7BB-13F1E37C018C","client_message_id":"8fbe64a7-6486-4bec-b73f-a486fade238c","delivery_state":"pending","created_at":"2026-04-27 16:26:04.161000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"agent-BDF88EAF-6D5E-4308-B7BB-13F1E37C018C","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":4096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","thread_system_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","attachments":[],"blocks":[],"reasoning_expanded":false,"reasoning_visibility":"full"}]}
