_2tffgkb9jiuw2te5hotk2zi5\",\"name\":\"query_tasks_by_member\",\"arguments\":\"{}\"}],\"role\":\"assistant\"}],\"id\":\"2F63A6F1-709E-4B21-8C02-91CEBF7AA3AB\",\"resultText\":\"tool.result.request_member_selection.completed\"}]","anchorToolCallID":"call_2tffgkb9jiuw2te5hotk2zi5","type":"pending_member_tool_cards"}],"blocks":[{"id":"9B237185-9E15-473B-AB9E-39352C37787E","text":"我需要了解您最近三天的运动和睡眠情况，才能进行分析并给出建议和生成健康任务。让我先查询这些数据。\n1. 首先调用 `fetch_workout_details` 获取最近三天的运动记录，因为运动记录是健康分析的重要部分，能了解您的活动类型和消耗。\n2. 同时调用 `fetch_sleep_details` 获取最近三天的睡眠数据，睡眠情况对健康分析至关重要，能了解您的睡眠质量和阶段分布。\n3. 另外还需要获取步数和能量消耗数据，调用 `fetch_step_details` 和 `fetch_energy_details` 来全面了解活动量。\n4. 之后调用 `query_tasks_by_member` 查看已有任务，避免生成重复任务。\n5. 最后根据收集到的数据生成健康任务，调用 `generate_task`。\n","kind":"text","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T17:49:39.087Z","createdAt":"2026-04-27T17:49:35.438Z"},{"kind":"tool","toolCallID":"call_mt2hcbgi1tfj6qtvzrjvukl5","anchor":{"value":"call_mt2hcbgi1tfj6qtvzrjvukl5","type":"toolCall"},"text":"正在使用工具：运动详情\n运动记录 2026-04-24 - 2026-04-26:\n- 2026年4月26日 18:59: 羽毛球，时长 2小时3分钟，距离 2.21 公里，活动能量 897.9 千卡，平均心率 137 bpm","createdAt":"2026-04-27T17:49:39.108Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T17:49:43.011Z","id":"45EA7FC1-E737-4958-8268-3CF5FEFDDE3E","toolName":"fetch_workout_details"},{"kind":"tool","toolCallID":"call_xaj5dis61bb5twhhuk316qia","anchor":{"value":"call_xaj5dis61bb5twhhuk316qia","type":"toolCall"},"text":"正在使用工具：睡眠详情\n2026-04-25 睡眠时长 250 分钟（深睡 28 分钟，核心 153 分钟，REM 69 分钟，清醒 8 分钟）","createdAt":"2026-04-27T17:49:40.148Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T17:49:43.088Z","id":"8C974931-847E-48A8-AD8F-0395D3EEF025","toolName":"fetch_sleep_details"},{"updatedAt":"2026-04-27T17:50:27.488Z","anchor":{"value":"call_xaj5dis61bb5twhhuk316qia","type":"toolCall"},"id":"D3B1595C-9DDE-4B01-A03E-DD2234D15077","toolCallID":"call_xaj5dis61bb5twhhuk316qia","kind":"sleepVisualization","sleepVisualization":{"days":[{"stages":{"awake":8,"rem":69,"unspecified":0,"deep":28,"core":153},"date":"2026-04-25","timeline":[{"startText":"03:34"